  subtitles:
  - startTime: 0
    endTime: 3
    text: 'Bamboo needs water to grow, '
  - startTime: 3
    endTime: 6
    text: 'and there is enough water here. '
  - startTime: 3
    endTime: 6
    text: 'But a panda eats huge amounts, '
  - startTime: 3
    endTime: 6
    text: 'and the bamboo is being eaten faster than it grows. '
  - startTime: 3
    endTime: 6
    text: 'Pandas normally follow the bamboo '
  - startTime: 3
    endTime: 6
    text: and travel down the mountain when it becomes scarce.
